15
00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:44.230
Yeah.

16
00:00:44.770 --> 00:00:45.090
All right.

17
00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:50.010
So you guys might know Christine from her time on the Nickelodeon 90s teen comedy, Hey Dude,

18
