67
00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:33.440
I just said, you can deliver it at my house.

68
00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:38.160
And I want you guys to know a truck showed up that was like the biggest thing I've ever seen.

69
00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:40.820
