70
00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:43.620
Wait, where did you store them all?

71
00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:45.060
Exactly, Christine.

72
00:03:45.240 --> 00:03:45.660
Exactly.

73
00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:54.660
