Like, what am I going to represent with my lunch each day for this year?

92
00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:04.000
And I think my first lunchbox, the one that I really remember, was Strawberry Shortcake.

93
00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:05.640
Oh, yes.

94
00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:07.860
Yes, I had a Strawberry Shortcake.

95
00:05:08.020 --> 00:05:10.100
Strawberry Shortcake with all my heart.

96
00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.500
