116
00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.360
Already into it.

117
00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:02.500
Already.

118
00:06:02.680 --> 00:06:02.920
You got it.

119
00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:03.640
I know.

120
00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:04.940
You already got it.

