00:23:36.910 --> 00:23:41.830
And Hey Dude was a sitcom, like a situation comedy set on a dude ranch.

502
00:23:42.090 --> 00:23:44.110
It was a multi-camera show, but it was outdoors.

503
00:23:44.170 --> 00:23:49.130
So I got to learn a little bit of sort of acting it on camera.

504
00:23:49.850 --> 00:23:54.830
But the Brady Bunch audition, I think I'd done two little movies when I moved to LA and then

505
00:23:54.830 --> 00:23:58.230
they were casting a replacement.

506
00:23:59.150 --> 00:24:04.650
I don't know if you guys remember, there was a tour that started in Chicago called the Real

