528
00:25:11.430 --> 00:25:14.670
Wait, you were in the live show before the movie?

529
00:25:15.090 --> 00:25:15.490
Yes.

530
00:25:15.770 --> 00:25:17.270
But only for like four weeks.

531
00:25:17.450 --> 00:25:20.310
But the thing about the real live Brady Bunch was they were all older.

532
00:25:20.470 --> 00:25:22.930
I was the youngest one in the group when I came in.

533
00:25:23.090 --> 00:25:24.490
They were adults doing.

534
00:25:24.610 --> 00:25:24.810
Right.

535
00:25:25.010 --> 00:25:25.150
Right.

536
00:25:25.470 --> 00:25:26.170
Played teenagers.

537
00:25:26.710 --> 00:25:26.770
Yeah.

538
00:25:26.950 --> 00:25:28.050
So I was the youngeSt.

539
00:25:28.270 --> 00:25:32.810
And I remember when I wrapped it up, the team that, you know, they just said, you know,

