00:26:10.990 --> 00:26:15.750
I went to Sherwood Schwartz's house and got to talk to him about the Brady Bunch.

549
00:26:16.030 --> 00:26:19.130
Sherwood Schwartz is the creator of the Brady Bunch and Gilligan's Island.

550
00:26:19.370 --> 00:26:20.130
And anyway.

