00:26:20.330 --> 00:26:22.550
Were you just like pinch, pinching yourself?

552
00:26:22.750 --> 00:26:23.190
Yes.

553
00:26:23.430 --> 00:26:26.010
Because this is the kid that had the Brady Bunch lunchbox.

554
00:26:26.290 --> 00:26:26.730
Yes.

555
00:26:26.950 --> 00:26:27.650
Oh my gosh.

556
00:26:28.070 --> 00:26:30.890
And all I would see was Sherwood Schwartz's name at the, you know.

557
00:26:30.890 --> 00:26:36.290
So yes, it was a pinch me moment that I cannot believe to this day that I still didn't keep

558
00:26:36.290 --> 00:26:41.370
my little tape from the answering machine, but who knew?

559
00:26:42.130 --> 00:26:47.510
So I have to ask you, Christine, as you're going through the process of auditioning for

560
00:26:47.510 --> 00:26:51.650
the movie, what was your like internal feeling?

