564
00:27:01.270 --> 00:27:02.070
I'm Pam.

565
00:27:02.330 --> 00:27:03.330
I feel it.

566
00:27:03.810 --> 00:27:06.770
Everything about me knows that I'm Pam.

567
00:27:07.090 --> 00:27:07.470
This is me.

