00:28:03.490 --> 00:28:06.050
I remember I felt great because I was so confident.

586
00:28:06.310 --> 00:28:08.030
I mean, it's what I'd been doing my whole life.

587
00:28:08.190 --> 00:28:12.330
I just felt like, you know, you get through the nerves of the audition, but I really felt

588
00:28:12.330 --> 00:28:17.910
like if I don't get this job, then I don't know that this is the business that I should

589
00:28:17.910 --> 00:28:18.570
be in.

590
00:28:19.230 --> 00:28:19.390
Yes.

591
00:28:19.510 --> 00:28:21.410
Like this was made for me.

592
00:28:21.710 --> 00:28:24.070
This, doing this was for me.

593
00:28:24.330 --> 00:28:29.150
So my audition, Deb brought me back immediately for Betty and the producers.

