00:29:02.190 --> 00:29:06.030
And I just remember Betty, who was not even a Brady bunch.

603
00:29:06.650 --> 00:29:11.030
Obviously she had been studying it, but it wasn't like she knew everything Brady.

604
00:29:11.030 --> 00:29:18.590
So I was bringing things that I don't think they even knew were Marsha-isms or Marsha-esque

605
00:29:18.590 --> 00:29:23.990
or Maureen McCormick's way of how she, and by the way, and I say it all the time when I

