608
00:29:31.570 --> 00:29:33.230
I didn't look at the shows.

609
00:29:34.090 --> 00:29:34.490
Yeah.

610
00:29:34.650 --> 00:29:37.730
I didn't look at the shows and say, this is ridiculous.

611
00:29:37.750 --> 00:29:39.090
This is so funny.

612
00:29:39.090 --> 00:29:43.510
This is how I'm going to parody this, but it was like, I love it so much.

