00:30:10.810 --> 00:30:11.810
You're so petite.

622
00:30:12.390 --> 00:30:12.790
Yes.

623
00:30:12.950 --> 00:30:20.570
And I say it because I've been, I'm not petite like you, Angela, but I'm like, I was not a

