00:30:20.570 --> 00:30:26.830
big person, but they, you know, they wanted me to lose 10 pounds, but I, it didn't matter.

625
00:30:26.970 --> 00:30:28.230
I was like, I'll lose 10 pounds.

626
00:30:28.230 --> 00:30:35.070
Like I'll, of course I was embarrassed when that ask came my way because by the way, it

