00:30:52.830 --> 00:30:58.710
I start to put the 10 pounds back on and you can see it.

634
00:30:58.850 --> 00:31:02.770
Like I'll come into a scene looking a little rounder.

635
00:31:02.770 --> 00:31:07.430
And then like, I exit the scene looking a little thinner just because of how they had

