00:33:04.490 --> 00:33:05.830
Like overnight?

675
00:33:05.830 --> 00:33:07.110
Overnight, you held on.

676
00:33:07.110 --> 00:33:08.650
My body was so.

677
00:33:08.810 --> 00:33:10.010
Your body was like, oh, I love this.

678
00:33:10.170 --> 00:33:10.290
Right.

679
00:33:10.430 --> 00:33:10.670
Yes.

680
00:33:10.790 --> 00:33:12.890
My body was so craving.

681
00:33:13.330 --> 00:33:15.650
My body was so eager for this cheeseburger.

682
00:33:16.070 --> 00:33:18.630
That it was like, we're keeping this cheeseburger forever.

683
00:33:18.910 --> 00:33:19.250
Right.

684
00:33:19.390 --> 00:33:20.890
We're going to hold on to this.

685
00:33:21.210 --> 00:33:21.450
Yes.

686
00:33:22.290 --> 00:33:23.330
And yeah.

687
00:33:23.330 --> 00:33:24.450
How do you cheat that?

688
00:33:24.570 --> 00:33:27.170
Like if it doesn't buckle and it's couture and a bodice.

