00:33:40.310 --> 00:33:43.190
We did not have matching riding outfits in the movie.

695
00:33:43.350 --> 00:33:44.830
But that was a crazy time.

696
00:33:44.970 --> 00:33:48.070
That's the only time that ever happened to me on a movie.

697
00:33:48.310 --> 00:33:53.430
