698
00:33:53.590 --> 00:33:55.910
Like they get muscles or they gain weight.

699
00:33:55.910 --> 00:34:05.410
But for me with this, I left that experience thinking, wow, that was a scrutiny I did not enjoy

700
00:34:06.670 --> 00:34:10.270
