701
00:34:10.470 --> 00:34:10.630
Right.

702
00:34:10.830 --> 00:34:17.030
And luckily when it was all over, I just kind of went back to eating and living the way I had before.

703
00:34:17.210 --> 00:34:21.390
But it could have, you know, it's hard, especially if you're younger, I think.

704
00:34:21.390 --> 00:34:22.450
And that's the thing.

705
00:34:22.530 --> 00:34:25.690
By the way, I was 23 years old, right, when I did it.

706
00:34:25.830 --> 00:34:30.710
So that's the time you're actually really coming into like a woman's body at that time.

707
00:34:30.730 --> 00:34:30.780
Yes.

708
00:34:30.870 --> 00:34:31.070
Right.

709
00:34:31.270 --> 00:34:32.790
You know, it's not like that.

710
00:34:33.970 --> 00:34:38.030
And I just remember I was so confident in what I was doing.

711
00:34:38.030 --> 00:34:41.090
So I never worried that the job was in jeopardy.

712
00:34:41.090 --> 00:34:43.670
