00:35:50.650 --> 00:35:52.270
Nobody knew, which was so great.

738
00:35:52.450 --> 00:35:58.910
Like we just had this sacred space to just get to know each other and so many similarities.

739
00:35:59.170 --> 00:36:03.990
And by the way, the greatest gift to me is that I'm not on Twitter, but I remember Ben

